Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.31,0:03:30.57,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,相信籠中安全
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.71,0:03:32.33,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,深信此為絕對
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.37,0:03:34.67,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至忘卻創作
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.82,0:03:37.46,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,那位置配不上光明
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.46,0:03:39.93,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,說出希望 拋下不滿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.93,0:03:41.82,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,拉起革命的旗幟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.99,0:03:46.36,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,去任何人無法趕上的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.37,0:03:52.37,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,終有一天 超越修羅之外
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.37,0:03:54.98,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,即使現在被壓制
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.06,0:03:57.85,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,使我的臥薪嘗膽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.93,0:04:02.45,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,也不會被奪走夢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:05.30,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,燃燒吧全身神經
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.47,0:04:10.04,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道向誰傳達的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:15.22,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有寄託意義
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.97,0:04:20.74,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,向著更光明
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:24.78,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,到達頂點為止
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.80,0:04:27.34,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,have an obsession for victory
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:29.96,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm proud of myself and you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.02,0:04:32.84,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,we must be the change we wish to see
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.96,0:04:39.42,shokugeki_text,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(300,250)\fs52.5\fn方正大黑_GBK\b0}本字幕由悠哈璃羽字幕社製作 僅供日語交流之用 請勿轉載
