Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.32,0:22:17.74,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}騙し騙されて 失った
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.84,0:22:21.19,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}罵り罵られて 奪った
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.38,0:22:25.22,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}守りべき正義をすり減らして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.34,0:22:28.58,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}勝ち取るものなどない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.67,0:22:32.25,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}籠の中から見上げた空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.41,0:22:35.82,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}雨上がりの青の眩しさに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.98,0:22:39.25,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}囚われたままじゃ居られない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.25,0:22:42.74,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}昔話なら捨てて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.74,0:22:46.30,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}明日が言うべきは他でもない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.48,0:22:49.97,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}突き動かすほどの本能だ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.13,0:22:53.37,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}ぼくはぼくじゃなきゃ居られない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.37,0:22:56.59,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}変われるほど器用じゃないさ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.42,0:22:03.61,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}響徹雲霄的霹靂
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.87,0:22:06.97,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}被閃光暈眩之時
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.48,0:22:10.62,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}絕對不要發出聲響
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.97,0:22:14.15,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}一動不動地忍受悄然靠近的影子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.32,0:22:17.74,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}爾虞我詐 難免失去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.84,0:22:21.19,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}爭吵不斷 相互奪取
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.38,0:22:25.22,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}本應守護的正義慢慢衰退
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.34,0:22:28.58,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}便無法贏取任何東西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.67,0:22:32.25,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}從籠中向上仰視的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.41,0:22:35.82,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}被雨後的藍色所閃耀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.98,0:22:39.25,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}不會就此甘願被囚禁
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.25,0:22:42.74,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}舊事都一併丟棄
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.74,0:22:46.30,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}明天要暢談的東西沒有別的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.48,0:22:49.97,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}是幾乎拉扯我前進的本能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.13,0:22:53.37,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}我不管什麼時候都必須是我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.37,0:22:56.59,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}因為我並不擅於改變
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.16,0:00:10.81,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,食堂方向人手不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.63,0:00:13.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幸平的食戟結束之前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.77,0:00:15.72,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不會讓你們對宿舍出手的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.71,0:00:18.24,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,防盜窗被破壞了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.74,0:00:21.23,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 要是進來了的話就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:23.30,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 情況很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.70,0:00:25.09,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有攻進來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.82,0:00:30.49,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在這種時候眼鏡…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.33,0:00:37.41,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 丸井
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.94,0:00:39.23,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這個是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.77,0:00:42.34,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幸平創真對叡山枝津也的食戟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.65,0:00:46.00,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,3比0以幸平勝利告終
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.59,0:00:48.58,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,創真君 贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.26,0:00:51.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 什麼什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.27,0:00:54.19,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.83,0:00:58.93,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真的打倒了十傑第九席了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.55,0:01:01.87,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是賭上席次的食戟的話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.25,0:01:05.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,叡山說不定會更加認真一點
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.78,0:01:07.39,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幸平創真
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.97,0:01:10.93,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,喲 一色
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.58,0:01:13.73,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直在整理文件啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.42,0:01:15.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 沒關係嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.27,0:01:19.09,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,現在的狀況可是要摧毀你的宿舍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.67,0:01:21.98,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在這種地方橫下心來旁觀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.98,0:01:24.34,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,極星寮不會被摧毀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.03,0:01:28.02,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,因為創真君知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.87,0:01:32.26,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,料理人的價值只能通過料理的對決衡量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.03,0:01:34.50,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是我看好的他
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.23,0:01:38.59,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,可以簡單的破解叡山君的小動作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.32,0:01:41.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不如說重要的是那之後
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.63,0:01:43.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真正的對決從那開始
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.72,0:01:46.80,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,為此的準備 無論如何都得提前做好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.42,0:01:53.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎麼說 按照一色想的那樣展開了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.07,0:01:56.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,強制搬離終止了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:01:58.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:00.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,手下都回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.92,0:02:02.25,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,有你們好看的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.50,0:02:04.83,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,極星寮不會再被摧毀了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:21.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.62,0:02:23.04,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.17,0:02:25.32,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,一個人去食戟挑戰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.46,0:02:27.11,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,都不和我們商量一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.11,0:02:28.74,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,太亂來了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.74,0:02:31.33,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 沒腦子 蠢材
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:34.88,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都很擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.29,0:02:36.90,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.99,0:02:40.85,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真的真的謝謝你 幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.33,0:02:46.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,創真君 歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.34,0:02:53.26,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你是怎麼打敗叡山枝津也的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.55,0:02:54.73,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,發生了很多事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.73,0:02:56.17,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.22,0:02:57.50,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這個頭盔是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.50,0:03:00.14,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 這個啊 是黃金時代的遺產
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.14,0:03:01.40,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這些話等會兒再說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.72,0:03:03.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,先進宿舍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.52,0:03:07.15,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 保住極星寮的慶功會
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.00,0:04:40.97,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fn方正行楷_GBK\c&H39393A&\move(1060.001,159,956.001,159)}極星永存慶功會
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.78,0:04:41.44,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,乾杯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.93,0:04:46.39,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\fad(450,0)\1a&H25&\c&H000000&\blur22.5\fscx435\fscy432\pos(180,1101)}m 39 0 b 39 -6 115.5 -6 115.5 0 b 115.5 7.5 39 6 39 0
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.93,0:04:46.39,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fad(450,0)\fs90\pos(348,1077)}狩獵餘黨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.62,0:04:48.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了 幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.83,0:04:50.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,新戶你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.38,0:04:54.06,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幸平 我看了你的食戟了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.13,0:04:55.62,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,塔克米親 伊薩米親
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.93,0:04:58.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,塔克米君平時的說教模式來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.35,0:05:00.52,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,！@#￥%……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:03.40,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀呀 沒有生氣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.62,0:05:04.73,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不責備他？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.81,0:05:05.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這也沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.34,0:05:09.06,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,因為自己的領域被威脅了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.56,0:05:11.23,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我也會做同樣的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.58,0:05:12.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,塔克米君
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.82,0:05:14.55,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,薙切同學晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.83,0:05:17.34,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真的在極星寮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:20.29,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你們好 阿爾迪尼同學們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.31,0:05:23.41,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎麼說這都是值得慶祝的晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.08,0:05:25.71,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你們也快來吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.25,0:05:29.87,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然是剛剛完成了困難的比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.89,0:05:32.50,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,全力地變成放鬆狀態了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.07,0:05:34.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 幸平好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.99,0:05:37.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,與第九席食戟取得壓倒性勝利
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.87,0:05:38.82,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.85,0:05:41.95,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,與第十席的小薙切比也有贏的可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.49,0:05:44.08,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,別開玩笑了 太失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.20,0:05:46.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,比起這個 誰是小薙切啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.11,0:05:53.58,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord4.5\fn微软雅黑\c&H031FE3&\3c&HFEFCFA&}小NG
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.11,0:05:53.58,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an9\bord4.5\fn微软雅黑\c&H031FE3&\3c&HFEFCFA&}繪里奈親…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.13,0:05:49.28,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,明明接受了吉野說繪里奈親的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.76,0:05:51.00,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,小就是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:52.80,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有威嚴感
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.91,0:05:53.88,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就是就是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:57.83,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,而且繪里奈大人是自謙才在第十席
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.83,0:05:58.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,實力是更…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.07,0:06:02.15,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那個食戟 題是我選的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:05.22,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,叡山前輩從途中才開始想菜譜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.43,0:06:07.28,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,居然還做出了那種程度的菜品
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.75,0:06:10.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,最近什麼時候一定要同等條件比一場
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.87,0:06:12.22,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有滿意呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.18,0:06:14.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這種感覺我懂 幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.66,0:06:17.76,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,說起來 其他要被摧毀的研究會 小組
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:19.30,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,現在怎麼樣了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.61,0:06:21.73,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,依然是在危機中沒有變
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.54,0:06:23.83,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 多虧了創真君
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.25,0:06:25.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,情況好轉了一點
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.60,0:06:27.32,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,一 一色前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.36,0:06:29.04,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你之前去哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.23,0:06:30.24,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 大家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.69,0:06:33.10,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我姑且還是十傑成員
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:35.53,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,貿然為宿舍暗中活動的話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.89,0:06:39.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,薊政權可能會施加更大的壓力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.08,0:06:43.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,話說回來 我還在猜你是不是背叛我們了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.69,0:06:45.50,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定真的會這麼幹啊 這個人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.60,0:06:48.15,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.56,0:06:51.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我有多麼愛著極星寮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.45,0:06:53.85,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你們都沒有明白嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.31,0:06:56.32,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那個 一色同學
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.74,0:06:58.51,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,事態好轉的意思是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.60,0:07:01.58,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,今天食戟的結果出來後
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.05,0:07:04.05,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,薊政權發出了新的聲明
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.72,0:07:08.67,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,中樞收到的研究會和小組賭上解體撤回的食戟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:10.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,今後全部接受
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.26,0:07:13.10,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,當然是在有中立的審查員的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.48,0:07:14.73,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,公正可期的基礎上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.89,0:07:19.79,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然還是學園全體在中樞的支配下沒有變
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.51,0:07:23.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,叡山君推行的 作弊戰略 已經被摧毀了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.77,0:07:25.03,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這是創真君的功績
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.63,0:07:27.55,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你讓食戟起死回生了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.23,0:07:29.28,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 創真君
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.03,0:07:31.73,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你救回了我們的宿舍
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.61,0:07:36.31,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不用客氣 這也是對我來說很重要的場所
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:40.09,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,也感謝大家保護極星寮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.78,0:07:43.06,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 嚴肅的話題就說到這
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:46.02,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,盡情享樂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:47.24,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.68,0:07:50.99,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼！？裸體圍裙！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.99,0:07:54.18,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,裸體？穿圍裙？…多麼黃暴的…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.22,0:07:57.15,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不能看 不能看啊 繪里奈大人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.72,0:08:03.98,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不管看幾次都很有衝擊力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.27,0:08:06.94,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,果然感覺極星寮不能沒有這個
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.04,0:08:11.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這個宿舍的人都怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.53,0:08:15.43,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,平靜的接受裸體圍裙什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.85,0:08:18.08,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,果然不可思議 這個宿舍
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.53,0:08:20.69,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 與其說不可思議
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.71,0:08:21.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不如說奇怪啦 奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.10,0:08:23.19,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪奇怪奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.66,0:08:24.52,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,繪里奈大人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.30,0:08:28.11,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,緋紗子你知道洗衣機的使用方法嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.22,0:08:30.41,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,, 洗衣機？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:32.58,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,…會 一般都…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.05,0:08:36.70,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊 用那種全是按鈕的機械什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.04,0:08:37.82,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,很厲害呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.40,0:08:39.95,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那個 繪里奈大人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.06,0:08:42.50,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,算…算了 洗衣機的事就這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:44.70,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,總之就是這個宿舍有很多我一直不知道的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.78,0:08:48.09,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,還有各種不可思議的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.57,0:08:49.37,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.85,0:08:51.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不可思議的人們
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.11,0:08:56.11,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,而在他們中心的就是幸平君
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.83,0:08:58.84,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,極星寮受到襲擊的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.26,0:09:03.55,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,宿舍的人們好像都在心裡相信著
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.55,0:09:06.39,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幸平君的話一定會創造奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.46,0:09:09.74,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,而且你也是 緋紗子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.10,0:09:11.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.38,0:09:13.08,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.54,0:09:18.19,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好像知道幸平君會做什麼一樣的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.47,0:09:19.23,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.67,0:09:22.97,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 這個 怎麼說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.38,0:09:27.79,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然沒什麼根據 但是我有預感
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.48,0:09:31.81,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定 從薊先生手中解救現在的遠月的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.57,0:09:35.70,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,可能就是這個男人了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.47,0:09:42.80,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,薙切君 新戶君 你們也過來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.26,0:09:45.52,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,請穿上衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:48.32,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的 只要習慣了 這也是好事情喲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.37,0:09:49.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,完全不能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.47,0:09:50.18,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.48,0:09:54.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,十傑第七席一色慧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.31,0:09:59.44,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,從今開始請你退出遠月十傑評議會
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.93,0:10:05.03,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,和第三席女木島冬鋪 第八席久我照紀一起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.38,0:10:07.34,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,比我預想的要早
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.87,0:10:09.87,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,比我預想的要沒有動搖
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.18,0:10:12.67,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,因為已經知道會變成這樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.11,0:10:15.11,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不接受中樞的思想的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.11,0:10:16.25,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,卻在十傑的位置上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.58,0:10:17.94,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,實在很礙事對嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.67,0:10:20.05,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你能這麼快理解真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:23.30,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,其他的十傑成員也同意
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.84,0:10:26.62,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不用吧不用吧沒必要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:30.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得不用從十傑里撤去也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.04,0:10:33.92,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不過只有小林龍膽反對
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.39,0:10:35.41,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,薙切繪里奈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.00,0:10:38.46,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你的女兒沒有被撤去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:41.41,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,她一定會回到我這裡的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.01,0:10:45.82,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我確信 她會贊同我的意志
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.31,0:10:49.30,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,拜你所賜 又要忙起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.72,0:10:51.20,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,食戟 是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.54,0:10:55.30,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 遵守你疏通各處讓大家認同的…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.44,0:10:57.58,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這個新規則
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.26,0:11:02.45,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,必須與想要撤回解體命令的研究會和小組對決
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.31,0:11:07.10,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,用我自豪的中樞的軍隊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.07,0:11:11.63,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,研究會和小組對於想要薊政權
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.70,0:11:14.95,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,撤回解體命令的食戟的相關規則
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:17.13,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,俗稱 一色規則
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.64,0:11:20.19,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,自己的名字命名 俗稱什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.19,0:11:21.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,讓人火大
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.37,0:11:26.13,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 一色明文禁止與審查員的私下接觸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.21,0:11:28.59,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,確保了審查的公平性
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:33.44,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然我最初就反對作弊戰略
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.96,0:11:40.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,還有中樞必須接受撤回解體的食戟的條目
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.79,0:11:43.69,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,一色這個傢伙 真是滴水不漏
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.86,0:11:48.29,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這個緣故不得不認真比賽 好氣哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.72,0:11:51.32,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,因為小桃在月饗祭是綜合第一
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.32,0:11:53.59,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得全部不戰而勝就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.91,0:11:55.78,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,放棄吧 桃前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.20,0:12:00.50,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,還有龍膽前輩請把中樞的徽章戴好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.86,0:12:04.05,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,很礙事啊 那個玩意兒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.19,0:12:05.62,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,別抱怨了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.80,0:12:06.98,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.98,0:12:08.09,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,別說什麼但是了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.98,0:12:09.85,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.15,0:12:11.73,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你們也好好戴上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.90,0:12:13.51,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不然會被寧寧說教的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.68,0:12:16.15,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,還用得著你說麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.25,0:12:22.82,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼我們就上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.57,0:12:25.84,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,開始狩獵餘黨吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.28,0:12:29.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,狩獵餘黨？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.72,0:12:32.55,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,請求撤回解體命令的團體進行的食戟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.87,0:12:34.95,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,中樞就是這樣稱呼這件事的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.43,0:12:37.00,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,今天就是狩獵餘黨的第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.13,0:12:39.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺有點不爽呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:42.82,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,出戰的似乎都是中樞那邊的學生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.58,0:12:45.15,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,其中包括薊派的十傑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.75,0:12:48.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,之外的都是被稱為十傑預備軍的強者
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.98,0:12:51.67,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,十傑預備軍麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.15,0:12:54.33,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真想看看是些什麼傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.04,0:12:56.85,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,他又想搞些什麼事情了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.95,0:12:58.91,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再單獨行動了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.13,0:13:01.55,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是要去看食戟的話我也去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.23,0:13:05.05,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,因為只有你一個人去的話是很讓人擔心的 幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.07,0:13:07.17,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,小塔克米也去的話就讓人安心了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.21,0:13:10.72,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,話說 他們已經經常來寮玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.84,0:13:12.30,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我 我也想一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.69,0:13:15.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,因為他們也要和鄉土料理研進行食戟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.72,0:13:18.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,確實 我的宮裡研究會也要和他們進行戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.23,0:13:20.69,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,事先看看會有好處
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.93,0:13:23.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,食戟會場好像分成了四個呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:26.62,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼大家分頭行動就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.42,0:13:28.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就這麼幹吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.11,0:13:32.39,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼我們去A會場
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.39,0:13:33.37,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.00,0:13:35.90,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我們去B會場
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.10,0:13:38.84,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,外出期間 我有點擔心繪里奈大人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.02,0:13:40.78,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,小薙切沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.78,0:13:42.32,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,畢竟有文緒婆婆在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.32,0:13:43.91,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 別稱繪里奈大人為小薙切
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.98,0:13:44.99,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.19,0:13:48.22,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 我們往C會場去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.76,0:13:51.63,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幸平 今天只是去偵察而已
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.90,0:13:52.93,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,別做什麼出格的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.46,0:13:54.69,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂的 我懂的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:06.10,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不清楚什麼狩獵餘黨
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.46,0:14:09.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我還有一口氣就不會允許有卑鄙的事情發生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.62,0:14:13.43,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我們會負起責任公平地判決
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.68,0:14:15.92,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好多人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.36,0:14:21.79,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,現在是第四席的茜久保桃前輩與巧克力研究會對戰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:24.49,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,還有睿山前輩與西餐研究會對戰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.25,0:14:29.02,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,一個會場中有複數的食戟互不干擾地進行著
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.09,0:14:31.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,蓋研那幫傢伙不在這邊麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.69,0:14:33.53,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,而且汐研究會的葉山也不在
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.89,0:14:35.06,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,要上了 布奇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.51,0:14:37.22,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,來幫桃做菜了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.32,0:14:51.90,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,烤得順利嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.95,0:14:54.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,把玩偶的兩隻手摘下來當手套…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.27,0:14:56.16,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣做有什麼意義麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.38,0:14:58.91,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,據說她每次都會這樣做的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.90,0:15:01.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,手法真是熟練
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.09,0:15:04.80,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,的確具備遠月學園第一甜點師的實力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.94,0:15:09.91,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,紅葉狩獵那時候吃的蛋糕也很好吃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:11.53,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:13.11,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.53,0:15:14.98,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼味道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.55,0:15:24.46,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,茜久保桃和叡山枝津也都完勝了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.16,0:15:26.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.12,0:15:28.23,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,中樞那邊完勝麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.01,0:15:31.22,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真想和他們一戰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.43,0:15:32.43,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,創真君
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.56,0:15:34.49,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幸平 我知道我可能很煩人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.49,0:15:36.11,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但今天只是來偵察的而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.11,0:15:37.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不要上去挑戰…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.47,0:15:39.49,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道啦 我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.19,0:15:41.45,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.30,0:15:45.79,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,話說 沒有看過睿山前輩的招牌菜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.13,0:15:49.44,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,下次等到雙方都好好準備過後再來食戟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:50.91,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,日後認真決勝負
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.21,0:15:52.05,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.05,0:15:54.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不會就這麼算了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.37,0:15:58.59,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,做出讓我丟臉這種事情我會讓你後悔的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.74,0:16:00.40,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在發脾氣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.62,0:16:03.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我說你 根本就不是做十傑的料吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:06.16,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 現在來交接接力棒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.31,0:16:08.45,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,等等的食戟就交給我們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:11.17,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,輸給一年級小鬼的叡山君
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.91,0:16:18.03,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,由薙切薊選拔的中樞的軍隊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:21.04,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,現在正支配著遠月的廚師
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.07,0:16:23.43,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真的可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.71,0:16:24.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,對決主題的那件事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.13,0:16:30.26,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,無所謂 我們全部都以你們擅長的料理來決勝負
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.59,0:16:35.37,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,用你們一直研究的料理種類來擊潰你們
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.44,0:16:37.08,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,趣味真是低級
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.15,0:16:39.69,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,故意做小看對手的這種事情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.03,0:16:45.36,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這樣贏起來才更爽嘛 桃前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.23,0:16:47.48,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7}維多利亞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.23,0:16:47.48,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7}西班牙料理研
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.48,0:16:47.18,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,隨便你們小看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:51.62,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我們好歹也一直在遠月磨練
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.83,0:16:53.34,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,才不會這麼簡單就…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.06,0:17:02.23,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 選擇吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.92,0:17:08.62,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,老老實實地解散研究會亦或是從遠月退學
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.47,0:17:12.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我接受解散
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.87,0:17:16.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,無論哪一個都是雜魚啊 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.92,0:17:18.32,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣你們就清楚了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.82,0:17:21.06,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你們沒有被選中啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.53,0:17:22.74,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,所以屈服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.14,0:17:24.79,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,屈服對你們來說就是正確的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.29,0:17:28.25,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,一直對我們中樞低頭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.73,0:17:31.32,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就是你們最後的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.21,0:17:33.66,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這可不能當做沒聽見呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.57,0:17:38.69,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你們說了什么么 一年級小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.99,0:17:42.09,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,單方面就決定我們的價值這件事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.17,0:17:44.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我們無法認同
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.47,0:17:47.55,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不說創真君連塔克米君也…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.64,0:17:49.91,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,打敗叡山的一年級生和
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.16,0:17:53.41,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,另一個在秋季選拔賽也有出場的對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.60,0:17:56.24,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我勸你們不要說那麼嘚瑟的話會比較好喲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.62,0:17:59.70,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,向肩負下個世代料理界的菁英的我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.15,0:18:01.02,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,菁英？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.07,0:18:05.76,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊 我們是被現學園總帥選中的菁英
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.47,0:18:08.87,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不要反抗會比較好喲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:11.11,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺不到你們的個性呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.39,0:18:14.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,強調自己是被選中只能讓我覺得是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.87,0:18:18.20,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你們在把到現在為止所品嚐到的劣等感發洩出來而已
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.55,0:18:21.91,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要用菁英這一詞來裝飾自己證明
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.64,0:18:25.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定對自己的料理沒什麼自信吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.63,0:18:29.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,說得真棒呢 塔克米
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.01,0:18:32.04,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼樣前輩 你覺得呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.26,0:18:36.13,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你們這些傢伙 現在就讓我來擊潰…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.43,0:18:39.99,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不要做 多餘的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.09,0:18:42.17,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,繁 放開我 喂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.44,0:18:43.51,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不放
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.51,0:18:45.28,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂了 我聽你話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.67,0:18:46.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我會聽你話的啦 放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.82,0:18:47.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,別把我搬走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.03,0:18:51.34,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 太容易給挑釁了 小蓮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.34,0:18:52.25,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了 芽亞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.62,0:18:53.67,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,一年級小鬼們
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.03,0:18:56.71,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,總有一天要和你們一戰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.02,0:18:59.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦 去吧去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.72,0:19:02.11,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,把最後的比賽也結果掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.91,0:19:06.62,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那個前輩還要比賽麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.80,0:19:07.90,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,比賽對手是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.20,0:19:12.14,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,薙切愛麗絲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.58,0:19:13.49,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,黑木場
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.52,0:19:16.34,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你們兩個 貴安呀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.46,0:19:17.72,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼你們會…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.20,0:19:19.72,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,進了什麼研究會嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.18,0:19:21.79,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,關於這一點連我自己也嚇了一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.01,0:19:23.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我還是初中生的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.01,0:19:26.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,和最先進料理研究會進行了食戟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.00,0:19:28.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,當然是贏了喲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.47,0:19:31.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,然後把活動室和器材全都奪過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.09,0:19:36.36,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,而通知書寫上寫的主將就變成我了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.36,0:19:37.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真是把我嚇一跳了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.27,0:19:39.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,各種意義上都好過分呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.06,0:19:43.43,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,然後就變成狩獵餘黨的對象了麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.29,0:19:47.84,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,把我稱為愛麗絲主將也沒關係喲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.95,0:19:49.52,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,明明自己還一直都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.89,0:19:53.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是那樣的話解散了也無所謂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.99,0:19:57.08,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,本因如此的…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.31,0:20:00.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,綜上 最先進研要被解散了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.91,0:20:04.93,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我來接受請求撤回解散命令的食戟也可以喲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.20,0:20:07.68,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了 無所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:12.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然對主將這個頭銜覺得新鮮 沒了有點遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.35,0:20:13.55,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我對研究會沒什麼興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.82,0:20:15.15,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,能請你回去了麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.66,0:20:21.01,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,聰明 靜靜地看著薊政權的繁榮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.41,0:20:23.31,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你們這些雜魚廚師
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.42,0:20:26.11,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你說誰是雜魚來著
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.41,0:20:28.09,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 突然之間幹嘛了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.32,0:20:31.62,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不管哪個傢伙來找茬我都會將其咬碎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.03,0:20:35.05,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,用我的料理來將你擊敗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:37.17,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,涼君
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.60,0:20:40.61,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 這場食戟 接下了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.06,0:20:43.98,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,綜上 要進行食戟的是涼君
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.11,0:20:46.43,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧 涼君
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.86,0:20:50.20,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,把自稱菁英的人的假面具扒下來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.61,0:20:51.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.92,0:20:55.62,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,C會場第一天最後的食戟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.06,0:20:57.24,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,黑木場君
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.88,0:21:00.91,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,廚房的獨裁者黑木場涼對
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.10,0:21:03.92,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,中樞的新人 楠蓮太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.25,0:21:06.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,涼君 不許輸喲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.82,0:21:09.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這是最先進料理研主將的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.70,0:21:14.38,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再讓薊叔叔為所欲為了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.70,0:21:15.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,黑木場涼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.27,0:21:19.45,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在秋季選拔賽存活到決賽的廚師麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.76,0:21:22.34,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才發生了些讓我不爽的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.99,0:21:25.25,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就讓我拿你來出出氣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.93,0:21:30.15,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,作為第一天最後要打趴的對手來說相當不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.38,0:21:33.39,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你想把我打趴下的話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.07,0:21:36.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那我把你打回去就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.39,0:23:10.94,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,加油 黑木場
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.28,0:23:12.87,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我們在這裡看著你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.91,0:23:18.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉呢 在這種特等席打擾你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.62,0:23:25.18,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,桃前輩平常是那樣的啦 不用在意
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.31,0:23:30.03,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,到可以看著臉說話這種程度至少需要一個月
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.35,0:23:35.50,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話合宿和實地研習之類的你是如何過關的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.59,0:23:38.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那種事情沒有向你說明的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.89,0:23:39.87,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真讓人不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.87,0:23:41.37,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,唉 你說什麼 你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.45,0:23:43.73,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,創真君 你太喋喋不休了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.87,0:23:46.61,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這次的主題食材是鮭魚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.97,0:23:49.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這鮭魚真不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.25,0:23:50.91,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,腮的色澤真是漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.44,0:23:52.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,海鮮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.41,0:23:55.18,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,涼君 全神貫注地上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.82,0:23:58.90,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,楠連太郎對黑木場涼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.51,0:24:03.19,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,開始食戟
